            "answer": "<p>Our Digital Gift Cards offer the ultimate gifting flexibility with instant inbox delivery. The recipient can redeem their gift card on our website to customize their own premium digital video book—choosing their preferred cover design (such as linen or vegan leather), screen size, and personal media uploads.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_KjU3Hx": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I commission custom video books for corporate gifting?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely. We provide bespoke Personalized Custom Digital Video Books perfect for VIP corporate gifting, real estate portfolios, and high-end presentations. With custom foil-stamped covers and offline playback, it is a striking physical presentation that bypasses digital email filters entirely. Please contact us for bulk ordering.</p>"
